 intended tool usage might be a \"Tool Selection Error\" as well.\n\nI need to check each error against the taxonomy categories. The main issues are tool errors (UnboundLocalError), incorrect tool usage leading to invalid results, and relying on external data instead of processing the report. These map to specific error categories under Reasoning, Tool Selection, and System Execution.\n</think>\n```json\n{\n    \"errors\": [\n        {\n            \"category\": \"Tool Selection Errors\",\n            \"location\": \"c08431428d160555\",\n            \"evidence\": \"inspect_file_as_text tool failed due to UnboundLocalError\",\n            \"description\": \"Incorrect tool selection or misconfiguration led to runtime error in text analysis tool.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"category\": \"Information Misattribution\",\n            \"location\": \"d5e6b12e911d9365\",\n            \"evidence\": \"Final answer '8' derived from external analysis instead of direct report processing\",\n            \"description\": \"Answer based on external sources rather than actual document analysis.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"category\": \"Resource Abuse\",\n            \"location\": \"c618b0e980728f31\",\n            \"evidence\": \"Repeated failed calls to inspect_file_as_text tool\",\n            \"description\": \"Excessive tool calls without successful execution.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"scores\": [\n        {\n            \"category\": \"reliability\",\n            \"score\": 2,\n            \"reason\": \"Multiple tool failures and reliance on external data\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"category\": \"security\",\n            \"score\": 4,\n            \"reason\": \"No security issues identified\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```",
